 zeke first arrived on  the island  elena and the volunteers were all held  at gunpoint but even then she remained  calm  and said one day they would eat at the  same table again at the time we didn't  know why she was so relaxed but it's  because she knew that pixis and the  other military officials  had been contaminated with the wine and  that they'd soon be forced into this  position  here she makes good on that promise that  they'd all be dying at the same table  although pixis himself was refusing to  eat  we get a few relevant bits of info out  of their conversation with the first  being that all military soldiers have  been gathered in shiganjana  before the jaeger's takeover occurred  shiganchena was already set to be  evacuated since zachary wanted to use it  as a testing ground for the rumbling  as a result it meant that no civilians  were in the district which is why it's  the only safe place for these  contaminated soldiers to go  elena has made the soldiers where  different armbands to indicate their new  status  with the white bands meaning they've  willingly defected to the aegiris and  likely was on their side even before the  truth of the wine was revealed  red armbands indicate they've been  forced to work for the igris after  finding out about the wine  and the black armbands just mean you're  screwed given that aaron zeke and elena  will be in charge of the island for the  foreseeable future  people with the black armbands will have  the lowest social standing in society  which pix's notes is very similar to how  marley does things  in the last episode we discovered that  zeke's true intention is to eliminate  the aldean race  therefore saving the world from the  titans and saving the eldens from their  suffering  the only people who knew about that true  plan were the yeager brothers themselves  and elena because she was the one that  told aaron about it during their secret  meeting  other volunteers like onyankapon had no  idea so when she sort of let it slip  during this conversation  it understandably gets a shocked  reaction from the crowd these guys never  assumed there was another ulterior  motive  as far as they were concerned this  takeover of the island was just a way  for them to live in luxury  you can tell in the following scenes  that onyankapon is somewhat  uncomfortable with the way things are  progressing  but for now at least he has to go along  with it because understandably he does  not want his brains blown out by elena  previously we saw that after aaron was  finished beating up and insulting his  friends  he ordered for them to be sent to  shiganjana which is where they're locked  up in this underground prison  i explained in my review of episode 14  why shiganchina is likely the place  where zeke and aaron agreed to meet so  it's interesting that he would demand  that armin mikasa and the rest of the  gang be sent to the same location as  well  he could have had them sent to any  prison but for some reason he chose one  in shiganshina and in the jail cell  jean questions whether eren might have a  hidden motive after  all he's doing a lot of things that are  out of character but for now this  question remains up in the air  when elena arrives she explains the full  details of the true plan  and this scene where she shoots griez is  very interesting as it shows us just how  much he buys into zeke's philosophy  zeke believes his plan will save the  eldian race from suffering so he sees it  as something that will help them rather  than hurt them  and this is exactly what elena thinks as  well that's why when this guy was  disrespecting sasha by calling her a  devil  he was unknowingly showing that he  wasn't on board with zeke's plan clearly  he sees aliens as lesser than himself  and never sought to actually help them  by any definition of the word  so by default that mindset doesn't  really go hand in hand with what elaine  is trying to achieve  onyankapon once mentioned that elena  