ation  would kill the warrior candidate  immediately  during their walk to the roof it's clear  that neither she nor mali  know exactly why zeke has such special  powers but pique was clever enough to  speculate that he can draw out the power  of the founding titan  time and time again she has proven  herself to be the most observant of the  current warriors  and on this occasion it was zeke's words  back in season 3 that made her come to  this realization  until then she always felt like zeke was  lying but in this moment when zeke met  his younger brother  she could tell that he was telling the  truth so when you look at the full  context of the situation now  that's why she assumed that maybe he  could help aaron use the founding titan  she later questions why erin isn't using  the founder which is yet another way of  her assessing just how much of the power  he can use  as they reach the roof yelena has a  firing squad ready to go in case pique  tricks them  and of course aaron had already cut his  finger in case he needed to transform  this was really a life or death  situation for the warriors gabby in  particular  but at this moment poco bursts through  the roof and eats aaron's legs  this prompted aaron to transform as well  and i'm pretty sure it's the first time  we've seen mapper animate  either of these titans in 2d with the  attack titan looking especially good  in the ideal scenario galliard would  have eaten the spine and would have  inherited the founding titan  attack titan and warhammer titan in this  one bite  so it is unlucky that he literally  missed by inches regardless  the smoke from this transformation was  enough for incoming malian forces to  pinpoint the founder's location  aboard the airship his cult whose main  priority is to save falco  and obviously reiner is there as well  who has come to get revenge for liberio  without reiner's interference  marley was going to wait six months to  launch an attack with the rest of the  world  so th